  (text "PHYSICAL J_LCD IS INTENTIONALLY NOT INSTANTIATED IN REV A SCHEMATIC YET." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 145 108 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0a0000bb-a000-4a00-8a00-0000000000bc"))
  (text "FPC source: SOFNG 0.5TBQP-30P-1 / C3975120, 30 contacts @0.5mm. A9 resolved: 31/32 are GND shell/mount refs; 15/16/18/19 are NC. Gate remains: final panel + contact-side/mating geometry + 3V3 domain." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 145 113 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0a0000bc-a000-4a00-8a00-0000000000bd"))
  (text "Panel-side nets prepared. Original FPC pins 4/21/29 share ESP_3V3; do not bridge M1 3V3_LCD and 3V3_TOUCH until panel internal-common status is confirmed." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 145 118 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0a0000bd-a000-4a00-8a00-0000000000be"))
  (text "MIPI DPHY 2.5V generation/decoupling and 4.02k DSI_REXT are already implemented in sheet 03_P4_CORE; do not duplicate them here." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 145 123 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0a0000be-a000-4a00-8a00-0000000000bf"))
  (text "DSI layout target: 100R differential ±10%; intra-pair skew <10mil; pair-to-pair target <30mil; continuous GND reference." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 145 128 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0a0000bf-a000-4a00-8a00-0000000000c0"))
  (text "M1 backlight baseline: direct EN PWM at 1kHz in BSP, ~74mA nominal LED current from 3.9R || 2.2R and 104mV FB. L_BL = XGL4030-103MEC, 10uH." (exclude_from_sim no) (at 145 133 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left)) (uuid "0a0000c0-a000-4a00-8a00-0000000000c1"))
